After several speeches[ from students,] the GSC and the gathered students tried to[ deliver request] proposal[ to J]ogye Order together, but police officers blocked the way. Therefore, only[ ten representatives were allowed to go to deliver the request] proposal[ to the] persons concerned of the Jogye Order at the temple gate.[ The] request proposal[ involves following three demands:] Jogye Order has to stop intervening in the school matters and should guarantee the school’s autonomy, every sunim who spoiled the school needs to apologize and resign, and board of directors should be reformed in a more democratic way.

